  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) conducted a search of a residence in Cipete, South Jakarta, previously occupied by a former inspector general. This action is part of an ongoing investigation into allegations of a treason plot against President Prabowo Subianto. Prior to the raid, the former high-ranking officer was dishonorably discharged from the police force. Official reports indicate the dismissal followed an internal ethics investigation that found the officer involved in the illicit wiretapping of the President. In response to these developments, the police have formed a Commission for Ethics Code Appeals (KKEP) to handle formal challenges submitted by the former officer and another individual involved in the case. The investigation remains ongoing as authorities work to uncover details surrounding the alleged operations and the purpose of the residence as a purported command post.",
